 "notes": "Den Osse Nieuwe Kerkweg (also called Kerkepad): the steiger with its steps, the basalt field and old dike to the west, the concrete slabs on the old strekdam straight out and the reefballs to the east, with the 4/7/15 m contours and the two usual loops; the slope continues to about 30 m past the fairway buoy. Steiger, buoy G 64 and shoreline from OpenStreetMap; positions are approximate.",
